            <a class="js-orcid" href="https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9574-2899"><span class="u-visually-hidden">ORCID: </span>orcid.org/0000-0001-9574-2899</a></span><sup class="u-js-hide"><a href="#Aff5">5</a></sup>, </li><li class="c-article-author-list__item c-article-author-list__item--hide-small-screen"><a data-test="author-name" data-track="click" data-track-action="open author" data-track-label="link" data-track-index="17_21" data-track-context="researcher popup with no profile" href="#auth-Giacomo-Corrielli-Aff5" data-author-popup="auth-Giacomo-Corrielli-Aff5" data-author-search="Corrielli, Giacomo">Giacomo Corrielli</a><span class="u-js-hide"> 
            <a class="js-orcid" href="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1329-8972"><span class="u-visually-hidden">ORCID: </span>orcid.org/0000-0002-1329-8972</a></span><sup class="u-js-hide"><a href="#Aff5">5</a></sup>, </li><li class="c-article-author-list__item c-article-author-list__item--hide-small-screen"><a data-test="author-name" data-track="click" data-track-action="open author" data-track-label="link" data-track-index="18_21" data-track-context="researcher popup with no profile" href="#auth-Ulysse-Chabaud-Aff6" data-author-popup="auth-Ulysse-Chabaud-Aff6" data-author-search="Chabaud, Ulysse">Ulysse Chabaud</a><sup class="u-js-hide"><a href="#Aff6">6</a></sup>, </li><li class="c-article-author-list__item c-article-author-list__item--hide-small-screen"><a data-test="author-name" data-track="click" data-track-action="open author" data-track-label="link" data-track-index="19_21" data-track-context="researcher popup with no profile" href="#auth-Roberto-Osellame-Aff5" data-author-popup="auth-Roberto-Osellame-Aff5" data-author-search="Osellame, Roberto">Roberto Osellame</a><span class="u-js-hide"> 
            <a class="js-orcid" href="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4457-9902"><span class="u-visually-hidden">ORCID: </span>orcid.org/0000-0002-4457-9902</a></span><sup class="u-js-hide"><a href="#Aff5">5</a></sup>, </li><li class="c-article-author-list__item c-article-author-list__item--hide-small-screen"><a data-test="author-name" data-track="click" data-track-action="open author" data-track-label="link" data-track-index="20_21" data-track-context="researcher popup with no profile" href="#auth-Massimiliano-Dispenza-Aff2" data-author-popup="auth-Massimiliano-Dispenza-Aff2" data-author-search="Dispenza, Massimiliano">Massimiliano Dispenza</a><sup class="u-js-hide"><a href="#Aff2">2</a></sup> &amp; </li><li class="c-article-author-list__show-more" aria-label="Show all 21 authors for this article" title="Show all 21 authors for this article">…</li><li class="c-article-author-list__item"><a data-test="author-name" data-track="click" data-track-action="open author" data-track-label="link" data-track-index="21_21" data-track-context="researcher popup with no profile" href="#auth-Fabio-Sciarrino-Aff1" data-author-popup="auth-Fabio-Sciarrino-Aff1" data-author-search="Sciarrino, Fabio" data-corresp-id="c1">Fabio Sciarrino<svg width="16" height="16" focusable="false" role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="u-icon"><use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="#icon-eds-i-mail-medium"></use></svg></a><span class="u-js-hide"> 
